flowchart LR
    M[3D mesh] -- rasterize --> R[render 8 views]
    R -- 224x224 images --> E[image encoder]
    E -- pooler out --> V[per-view vectors]
    V -- stack and reduce --> P[pool: mean / max / attn]
    P -- L2 normalize --> O[one vector per object]
    O -- insert --> I[FAISS index]
    Q[query mesh] -- same path --> R
    I -- search --> N[top-k nearest objects]
